{"page":431,"verses":[{"verse_key":"34:23","surah":34,"ayah":23,"ar_uthmani":"وَلَا تَنفَعُ ٱلشَّفَـٰعَةُ عِندَهُۥٓ إِلَّا لِمَنْ أَذِنَ لَهُۥ ۚ حَتَّىٰٓ إِذَا فُزِّعَ عَن قُلُوبِهِمْ قَالُوا۟ مَاذَا قَالَ رَبُّكُمْ ۖ قَالُوا۟ ٱلْحَقَّ ۖ وَهُوَ ٱلْعَلِىُّ ٱلْكَبِيرُ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Intercession will not work with Him, except by those to whom He gives permission.’ They will be asked, after the terror is lifted from their hearts [on the Day of Judgement], ‘What did your Lord speak?’ and they will answer, ‘The Truth. He is the Most High, the Most Great.’","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَلَا","en_gloss":"And not","transliteration":"walā","verse_key":"34:23"},{"pos":2,"ar":"تَنفَعُ","en_gloss":"benefits","transliteration":"tanfaʿu","verse_key":"34:23"},{"pos":3,"ar":"ٱلشَّفَـٰعَةُ","en_gloss":"the intercession","transliteration":"l-shafāʿatu","verse_key":"34:23"},{"pos":4,"ar":"عِندَهُۥٓ","en_gloss":"with Him","transliteration":"ʿindahu","verse_key":"34:23"},{"pos":5,"ar":"إِلَّا","en_gloss":"except","transliteration":"illā","verse_key":"34:23"},{"pos":6,"ar":"لِمَنْ","en_gloss":"for (one) whom","transliteration":"liman","verse_key":"34:23"},{"pos":7,"ar":"أَذِنَ","en_gloss":"He permits","transliteration":"adhina","verse_key":"34:23"},{"pos":8,"ar":"لَهُۥ ۚ","en_gloss":"for him","transliteration":"lahu","verse_key":"34:23"},{"pos":9,"ar":"حَتَّىٰٓ","en_gloss":"Until","transliteration":"ḥattā","verse_key":"34:23"},{"pos":10,"ar":"إِذَا","en_gloss":"when","transliteration":"idhā","verse_key":"34:23"},{"pos":11,"ar":"فُزِّعَ","en_gloss":"fear is removed","transliteration":"fuzziʿa","verse_key":"34:23"},{"pos":12,"ar":"عَن","en_gloss":"on","transliteration":"ʿan","verse_key":"34:23"},{"pos":13,"ar":"قُلُوبِهِمْ","en_gloss":"their hearts","transliteration":"qulūbihim","verse_key":"34:23"},{"pos":14,"ar":"قَالُوا۟","en_gloss":"they will say","transliteration":"qālū","verse_key":"34:23"},{"pos":15,"ar":"مَاذَا","en_gloss":"What is that ","transliteration":"mādhā","verse